        "text": "<thinking> To create the file fetch_api_key.py that fetches an API key from a managed secrets store, I will use AWS Secrets Manager as the concrete external provider. This choice is based on its widespread use and the availability of a Python SDK. The code will import the boto3 library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, and use it to interact with AWS Secrets Manager. The provider will be identifiable in the code through the import of boto3 and the use of AWS-specific functions and constants. </thinking>\n",
